1
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:14,100
[A Prophet]

2
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,900
[Episode 8]

3
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,800
How is it?

4
00:03:29,190 --> 00:03:30,190
Do I look good

5
00:03:30,510 --> 00:03:31,190
in this?

6
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:37,750
Whatever.

7
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,840
You're not the groom anyway.

8
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:44,590
I feel like the outfit needs something.

9
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,300
Does it look familiar?

10
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,590
I had its band resized.

11
00:03:55,870 --> 00:03:56,590
Try it on.

12
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,240
But you've worn

13
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:00,890
this watch for many years, right?

14
00:04:03,050 --> 00:04:05,050
No matter what happened in the past,

15
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,240
from now on,

16
00:04:06,530 --> 00:04:08,250
every second

17
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,750
belongs to us.

18
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,720
Fair enough.

19
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,600
I suppose it's finally

20
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,690
back where it belongs.

21
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:24,240
Second Master Qian

22
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,330
isn't really planning to hand
all that money over to you, is he?

23
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,660
How do you know he isn't?

24
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,460
Whether he plans to or not,

25
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,900
that money isn't his anymore.

26
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,290
And it certainly

27
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:36,950
isn't yours.

28
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:38,680
So you were never

29
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,680
working with the Qian family

30
00:04:41,050 --> 00:04:42,980
on Feng Siyuan's behalf, were you?

31
00:04:43,950 --> 00:04:45,120
You're catching on.

32
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,420
I know exactly what you're thinking.

33
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:49,330
Feng Siyuan is just a pawn.

34
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,760
The Tianxiang Sect is the real target.

35
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,630
You want to use one
to bring down the other,

36
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:53,310
right?

37
00:04:56,659 --> 00:04:58,210
Are you warning me?

38
00:04:58,380 --> 00:05:00,840
I'm telling you that
you're being reckless.

39
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:04,780
The ledger isn't with Qian Huaiyi.

40
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,660
It's with the Eldest Master Qian.

41
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,950
I'm guessing

42
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:13,000
you don't even know

43
00:05:13,110 --> 00:05:14,600
what he looks like.

44
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:17,030
Why are you telling me this?

45
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:19,410
Let's just say I'm doing it

46
00:05:21,790 --> 00:05:22,710
for this.

47
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,480
Chengming.

48
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,159
Wenxin.

49
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,720
You're so badly injured.

50
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,700
You didn't have to meet me here.

51
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,360
I could have gone to your room.

52
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:42,270
It's not convenient to talk
with my wife in the room.

53
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:43,600
I just wanted to ask,

54
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,880
does what you promised me

55
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:46,950
still stand?

56
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,270
Of course it does.

57
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:49,600
Don't worry.

58
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,750
I've already spoken to Commander Feng.

59
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:54,350
You won't have taken
that beating for nothing.

60
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,940
Thank you, Chengming.

61
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,720
But don't worry.

62
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,940
I'll search every inch of the Qian family

63
00:05:58,940 --> 00:05:59,980
if I have to.

64
00:06:00,010 --> 00:06:01,740
I will find that ledger for you.

65
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:04,000
Thanks for your hard work, Wenxin.

66
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:05,950
But

67
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,030
why has the Eldest Master Qian

68
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:09,230
never shown himself?

69
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,720
I've been with the Qian family

70
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,480
for four or five years now.

71
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:14,720
But I've barely

72
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,230
seen him.

73
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:19,160
He's very elusive.

74
00:06:19,550 --> 00:06:20,550
Do you know

75
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,550
where he lives?

76
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:26,240
I do.

77
00:09:26,090 --> 00:09:27,850
Who are you?

78
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,210
Who brought you here?

79
00:09:42,170 --> 00:09:44,570
You're the Eldest Master Qian,
aren't you?

80
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,390
You know me?

81
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,120
Are you looking for me?

82
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:54,480
Bashen Powder

83
00:09:55,190 --> 00:09:56,880
is made right here.

84
00:09:57,350 --> 00:09:58,650
Don't touch that!

85
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,790
Try it.

86
00:10:10,810 --> 00:10:11,970
No, thanks.

87
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:18,380
This is good stuff.

88
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:21,400
You don't know what's good.

89
00:10:23,090 --> 00:10:25,290
Where did you find so many blind people?

90
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:30,650
I blinded them all.

91
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:36,070
The more they see of the outside world,

92
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,950
the more tainted their hearts

93
00:10:37,950 --> 00:10:39,360
become.

94
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,320
If their hearts aren't pure,

95
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,390
neither is the medicine

96
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:45,480
they make.

97
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,750
So they'd better

98
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:50,300
off without their eyes.

99
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:52,540
How beautiful.

100
00:10:58,550 --> 00:10:59,440
Brother,

101
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,840
how should I address you?

102
00:11:03,190 --> 00:11:03,760
I-

103
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,440
I'm here to buy medicine.

104
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:10,320
You're here to buy medicine?

105
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:11,470
Please go upstairs.

106
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:12,910
After you.

107
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:35,790
After you.

108
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:43,040
Why aren't the lights on?

109
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:45,960
I just heard you say

110
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,080
that Bashen Powder

111
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:52,490
has even made its way to Nanyang.

112
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:53,630
Yes.

113
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,360
Domestic merchants went to Nanyang

114
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:58,070
and spread the word about

115
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,550
its miraculous effects.

116
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,720
Is Nanyang

117
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:12,700
beautiful?

118
00:12:18,470 --> 00:12:20,870
There's something wrong with this candle.

119
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:40,250
You're quite smart.

120
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:41,960
Stay

121
00:12:42,390 --> 00:12:44,550
and make medicine with me.

122
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:47,090
Look at my candle wicks.

123
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:50,320
They're all made of top-grade herbs.

124
00:12:50,630 --> 00:12:52,120
Take a sniff,

125
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,360
and it won't hurt in a while.

126
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,530
Someone's here.

127
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:04,770
Someone wants to kill
your brother and sister.

128
00:13:14,430 --> 00:13:16,100
As long as I'm here,

129
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:19,320
no one lays a hand on them.

130
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:21,690
Brother!

131
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:22,840
Brother!

132
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,750
Save me!

133
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,080
Save me!

134
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:43,810
Who wants to kill my brother and sister?

135
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:49,190
Tianxiang Sect.

136
00:13:50,630 --> 00:13:51,930
How do you know?

137
00:13:52,570 --> 00:13:54,690
Your sister just killed someone
from Tianxiang Sect.

138
00:13:54,690 --> 00:13:56,550
And your brother has been secretly

139
00:13:56,550 --> 00:13:58,280
smuggling opium with Blind Du.

140
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,080
Tell me,

141
00:13:59,390 --> 00:14:00,920
if you were the Sect Master,

142
00:14:01,830 --> 00:14:03,160
would you let them go?

143
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:05,710
You're not here to buy medicine.

144
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,910
What exactly do you want?

145
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:12,140
I'm here to save you.

146
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,270
I'm an old man

147
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,670
who's lived long enough.

148
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,920
What about your brother and sister?

149
00:14:30,550 --> 00:14:33,150
What's your connection
to the Tianxiang Sect?

150
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:38,870
They

151
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:42,950
killed my brother and sister.

152
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:46,330
How did they die?

153
00:14:47,590 --> 00:14:49,320
They were poisoned by medicine

154
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:52,770
from the Qian family.

155
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,680
For generations, our family

156
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,550
has practiced medicine

157
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:02,150
and made remedies

158
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:04,400
to heal people.

159
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:08,020
Then why is it that every time
the Tianxiang Sect sets someone up,

160
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:10,930
the medicine comes from the Qian family?

161
00:15:10,930 --> 00:15:11,990
That's because...

162
00:15:12,150 --> 00:15:13,550
Because

163
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,870
we had nowhere

164
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:20,630
to hide!

165
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,430
If I hadn't agreed to them

166
00:15:23,430 --> 00:15:25,430
back then,

167
00:15:25,890 --> 00:15:29,560
my brother and sister
would have been the ones poisoned.

168
00:15:30,870 --> 00:15:32,470
My father was

169
00:15:33,410 --> 00:15:36,720
drowned alive by them back then.

170
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,030
If I hadn't agreed,

171
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:41,670
my brother and sister would have suffered

172
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,390
an even worse fate.

173
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:45,750
Sect Master is a devil

174
00:15:45,750 --> 00:15:48,320
who'd eat you alive
without a second thought.

175
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:51,200
If I ever cross paths with him again,

176
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,640
I'll risk my life

177
00:15:54,090 --> 00:15:56,780
to drag him straight to hell with me!

178
00:16:01,310 --> 00:16:02,280
Sect Master!

179
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:05,010
Sect Master, I didn't say anything!

180
00:16:05,010 --> 00:16:07,770
Sect Master, I didn't say anything!

181
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,150
They're here.

182
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:11,750
Who?

183
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:13,510
The trees

184
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:15,550
are full of their men.

185
00:16:15,910 --> 00:16:16,790
They are here!

186
00:16:16,790 --> 00:16:17,720
We're doomed!

187
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,390
Snap out of it.

188
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,870
You can't save anyone,

189
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:22,430
just like I couldn't save
my father back then!

190
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:27,330
Do you want to save
your brother and sister or not?

191
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:38,240
I'll show you a way out.

192
00:16:42,630 --> 00:16:43,480
What way?

193
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:46,160
Cooperate with Commander Feng.

194
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:48,670
What do you mean?

195
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,960
Commander Feng
wants your family's Bashen Powder.

196
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:53,020
Give me the ledger.

197
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:54,380
From now on,

198
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:56,540
we're in this together.

199
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:58,730
Can Commander Feng

200
00:16:59,590 --> 00:17:01,510
keep our whole family safe?

201
00:17:01,530 --> 00:17:02,660
In times like these,

202
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:05,079
what could protect us better than an army?

203
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,750
Think about Longxuya.

204
00:17:10,349 --> 00:17:11,240
Okay.

205
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,270
I agree.

206
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,810
Come get the ledger

207
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,319
tomorrow.

208
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,900
I've been waiting for you.

209
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:28,590
Come in.

210
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,070
Master,

211
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,550
this is our local specialty, Liubao tea.

212
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:37,400
Please try it.

213
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:38,780
Have a seat.

214
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:46,340
I won't sit.

215
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:47,610
I'll make it short.

216
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:48,830
Master,

217
00:17:49,550 --> 00:17:50,270
well,

218
00:17:50,810 --> 00:17:52,440
I took that beating

219
00:17:53,030 --> 00:17:55,030
with my wife watching from the side.

220
00:17:55,310 --> 00:17:56,640
I'm not asking for much.

221
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,590
I just want to know

222
00:17:57,590 --> 00:17:59,860
when I can finally hold my head high

223
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,600
in front of their family,

224
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:03,990
instead of having to
answer to them all the time.

225
00:18:03,990 --> 00:18:05,710
Is that really too much to ask?

226
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,190
From your features,

227
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:21,120
I'd say that even if you're not destined
for great wealth and status,

228
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,780
you're meant to have a fulfilling life

229
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:25,630
and a happy family.

230
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:27,550
Master, don't just look at my face.

231
00:18:27,550 --> 00:18:28,510
Take a look at my butt.

232
00:18:28,510 --> 00:18:29,840
Look what they did to me.

233
00:18:29,850 --> 00:18:30,960
You are a mortal.

234
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,360
All you can see

235
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:34,810
is the whip on your own butt.

236
00:18:35,030 --> 00:18:36,360
But I can see

237
00:18:36,390 --> 00:18:38,000
what's really weighing you down,

238
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:39,730
keeping you from your destiny.

239
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:43,030
It's a doomed relationship.

240
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:49,570
Master, where would our family
have a doomed relationship?

241
00:18:49,710 --> 00:18:50,390
Sorry,

242
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,610
I've said too much.

243
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,960
Master, please give me some more hints.

244
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,440
Drink your tea.

245
00:18:58,460 --> 00:18:59,190
Master,

246
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:02,530
this doomed relationship you mentioned...

247
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,950
You mean my wife, don't you?

248
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,640
I didn't say that.

249
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:08,110
I understand.

250
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:08,910
I understand.

251
00:19:09,910 --> 00:19:10,700
Master,

252
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:12,730
how can I break this curse?

253
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,550
I've seen that

254
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,490
your true match is still out there.

255
00:19:27,650 --> 00:19:28,960
I can't promise

256
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,160
she'll make you rich or successful,

257
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:33,960
but compared to the life
you're living now,

258
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,590
it'll be a world of difference.

259
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:43,600
She'll be a wonderful match

260
00:19:44,270 --> 00:19:46,590
for you.

261
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:48,270
It's just that your love life

262
00:19:48,270 --> 00:19:50,070
has been full of twists and turns,

263
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:52,130
with one mistake leading to another.

264
00:19:53,550 --> 00:19:54,810
Her name has something

265
00:19:55,310 --> 00:19:56,770
to do with a flower, right?

266
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,400
Yes, Master.

267
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,280
Her name is

268
00:20:00,310 --> 00:20:01,310
Bai Wenlan.

269
00:20:03,790 --> 00:20:04,680
I see that

270
00:20:04,950 --> 00:20:06,800
she is right by your side now.

271
00:20:08,030 --> 00:20:08,830
Impossible.

272
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,590
She left with someone else
a long time ago.

273
00:20:10,590 --> 00:20:11,960
She can't be by my side.

274
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:26,830
When you don't know which way to turn,

275
00:20:26,830 --> 00:20:28,160
ask the spring breeze.

276
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,660
But the spring breeze gives no answer.

277
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:31,680
So perhaps you should simply
follow your heart.

278
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:34,100
Since ancient times,
passion has only left empty regrets.

279
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:35,730
I wonder

280
00:20:36,340 --> 00:20:38,030
if it was the wind that
made the flowers fall,

281
00:20:38,030 --> 00:20:39,000
or

282
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:42,420
if the flowers were ready to
fall all along?

283
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:54,760
The spring breeze has its own sorrows.

284
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:58,800
Don't trouble the spring breeze
to worry for me.

285
00:21:49,310 --> 00:21:50,640
What's with this taste?

286
00:21:52,120 --> 00:21:53,430
They say wine gets better with age.

287
00:21:53,430 --> 00:21:55,830
How come this one's
only getting more sour?

288
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:57,810
I'm not drinking this anymore.

289
00:22:03,350 --> 00:22:05,590
How did the rain start all of a sudden?

290
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:08,000
I just fixed it a few days ago.

291
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:31,510
What are you doing here?

292
00:22:32,390 --> 00:22:33,990
Let's drink the rainwater

293
00:22:34,620 --> 00:22:36,820
and make a toast to a lifetime together.

294
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:41,000
You've been wronged.

295
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,570
Marrying you—

296
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:44,750
I don't feel wronged.

297
00:23:07,030 --> 00:23:08,160
Feeling any better?

298
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,750
The medicine will be ready soon.

299
00:23:09,750 --> 00:23:11,200
I'll brew it for you when we get home.

300
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:11,750
Okay.

301
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,480
You'll be fine soon.

302
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,000
Don't worry.

303
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:22,920
Miss Qian.

304
00:23:23,070 --> 00:23:23,880
Mr. Zhou.

305
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,230
thanks to you,

306
00:23:25,380 --> 00:23:26,900
my wife is feeling a bit better.

307
00:23:26,900 --> 00:23:27,530
Thank you.

308
00:23:27,650 --> 00:23:29,050
It's the least I could do.

309
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:31,550
Could I put this batch of medicine

310
00:23:31,670 --> 00:23:32,600
on my tab for now?

311
00:23:33,740 --> 00:23:35,410
You haven't paid for the last batch.

312
00:23:35,410 --> 00:23:36,370
No more credit.

313
00:23:37,140 --> 00:23:37,970
Why not

314
00:23:38,140 --> 00:23:40,070
pawn the ring your wife is wearing?

315
00:23:40,750 --> 00:23:42,030
I can't pawn this ring.

316
00:23:42,030 --> 00:23:43,440
It's the token of our love.

317
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,620
I can't pawn this ring.

318
00:23:44,620 --> 00:23:46,110
You can't even afford her medicine,

319
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:47,350
and you're still worried about
tokens of love?

320
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:48,160
Wang,

321
00:23:51,010 --> 00:23:54,050
Mr. Zhou, you truly have
deep affection for your wife.

322
00:23:55,590 --> 00:23:57,050
But getting her treatment comes first.

323
00:23:57,050 --> 00:23:58,960
You can pay for the medicine next time.

324
00:23:58,960 --> 00:23:59,560
Miss Qian.

325
00:24:02,750 --> 00:24:03,350
Mr. Zhou.

326
00:24:03,870 --> 00:24:05,430
Thank you, Miss Qian.

327
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,120
Thank you, Miss Qian.

328
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:11,720
Don't worry, Honey.

329
00:24:12,030 --> 00:24:13,090
Our fates are intertwined.

330
00:24:13,090 --> 00:24:14,550
We're bound by the same destiny.

331
00:24:14,550 --> 00:24:16,080
I will definitely cure you.

332
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:39,610
♪ The lantern waits for one
who won't return ♪

333
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:43,280
♪ My eyes hide a sorrow beyond words ♪

334
00:24:43,410 --> 00:24:46,540
♪ I ask for too much, then blame fate ♪

335
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,920
May your union bring wealth,

336
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:49,350
health, and longevity.

337
00:24:47,010 --> 00:24:50,030
♪ One year, one hardship, one fall ♪

338
00:24:49,750 --> 00:24:52,200
May you be blessed with many descendants

339
00:24:50,890 --> 00:24:56,080
♪ My greed burns away who I am ♪

340
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:55,070
and endless good fortune.

341
00:24:55,310 --> 00:24:56,680
Step over the brazier!

342
00:24:57,500 --> 00:25:03,080
♪ My anger clouds what I hold dear ♪

343
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:03,000
Thank you.

344
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:04,240
Mind the steps.

345
00:25:04,090 --> 00:25:10,390
♪ My obsession keeps me
from turning back ♪

346
00:25:04,270 --> 00:25:05,200
Be careful.

347
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,200
Thank you.

348
00:25:09,830 --> 00:25:11,640
Have a few more drinks later.

349
00:25:10,470 --> 00:25:16,430
♪ I keep my heart closed ♪

350
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:14,030
Congratulations, Second Master.

351
00:25:14,030 --> 00:25:14,960
Thank you.

352
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:15,920
Congratulations.

353
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,270
Thank you.

354
00:25:17,270 --> 00:25:18,590
Shuyi,

355
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:21,000
what's going on?

356
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:22,480
It's your big day,

357
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:25,450
and you haven't even offered
your brothers a drink.

358
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,270
Huaiyi,

359
00:25:32,430 --> 00:25:33,510
these are my brothers

360
00:25:33,510 --> 00:25:34,830
from my maiden home.

361
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:36,870
Your brothers from your maiden home?

362
00:25:36,870 --> 00:25:38,070
We've had a place ready
for them all along.

363
00:25:38,070 --> 00:25:38,600
This way.

364
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:38,970
Come,

365
00:25:38,990 --> 00:25:40,270
let's have our own people sit over here.

366
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:42,030
Everyone, please take a seat.

367
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,110
Come.

368
00:25:43,240 --> 00:25:44,160
Please sit down.

369
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:45,090
Take your seats.

370
00:25:45,830 --> 00:25:46,960
Is everyone seated?

371
00:25:49,160 --> 00:25:50,830
Why did you bring so many people?

372
00:25:50,830 --> 00:25:52,830
Just focus on putting on a good show.

373
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:54,310
Coming.

374
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:55,680
Second Madam,

375
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,680
this way.

376
00:26:04,710 --> 00:26:06,680
I, the Second Master,
am getting married today.

377
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:08,280
Have some wedding candy.

378
00:26:11,030 --> 00:26:12,030
Here.

379
00:26:14,670 --> 00:26:15,470
Here you go.

380
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:21,270
Here.

381
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:31,680
You heard me coming, didn't you?

382
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:47,600
Easy, easy.

383
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,270
It's

384
00:26:49,540 --> 00:26:51,060
my wedding day.

385
00:26:51,590 --> 00:26:53,450
I brought you some wedding candy.

386
00:27:00,270 --> 00:27:00,920
Come on

387
00:27:02,130 --> 00:27:03,060
Open your mouth.

388
00:27:41,870 --> 00:27:43,400
She'll be a wonderful match

389
00:27:43,730 --> 00:27:46,100
for you.

390
00:27:46,910 --> 00:27:48,310
It's just that your love life

391
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:50,110
has been full of twists and turns,

392
00:27:50,110 --> 00:27:52,170
with one mistake leading to another.

393
00:28:02,730 --> 00:28:03,910
The medicine is ready.

394
00:28:03,910 --> 00:28:05,370
Drink the medicine first.

395
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,590
Lie down for a while.

396
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,570
Why are you spacing out?

397
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,720
There are guests over there.

398
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:29,780
Go entertain them.

399
00:28:41,600 --> 00:28:42,800
Stop playing around.

400
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,030
What is going on?

401
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:47,230
What's with this guy?

402
00:29:04,310 --> 00:29:05,270
Who is he?

403
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:07,310
I heard he's a relative
of the Second Madam.

404
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:09,950
He's from the countryside
and has a terrible temper.

405
00:29:09,950 --> 00:29:12,350
The people at the table
behind you are, too.

406
00:29:26,670 --> 00:29:27,880
The Tianxiang Sect has sent someone.

407
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:28,850
I need to find the eldest Qian brother.

408
00:29:28,850 --> 00:29:29,370
Wait.

409
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:32,330
You found the eldest Qian brother?

410
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:33,370
He has the ledger.

411
00:29:33,370 --> 00:29:34,160
I'll come with you.

412
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:34,750
No need.

413
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:36,670
Keep an eye on them for me.

414
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,330
Eldest Master Qian!

415
00:30:10,790 --> 00:30:11,920
Eldest Master Qian!

416
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,270
It's gone.

417
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,070
It's gone.

418
00:30:25,750 --> 00:30:26,720
What's gone?

419
00:30:30,270 --> 00:30:31,330
The ledger is gone.

420
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:33,480
The ledger!

421
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,200
The ledger!

422
00:30:36,350 --> 00:30:37,550
When did this happen?

423
00:30:37,750 --> 00:30:39,150
When I came back that day,

424
00:30:40,310 --> 00:30:41,510
the ledger was gone.

425
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,160
It was them.

426
00:30:43,820 --> 00:30:44,690
They are here.

427
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,490
Eldest Master Qian,

428
00:30:49,490 --> 00:30:52,790
Second Master and Second Madam asked me
to bring you some wedding candies.

429
00:30:52,790 --> 00:30:53,550
Brother,

430
00:30:54,790 --> 00:30:55,720
have some candy.

431
00:30:56,750 --> 00:30:57,680
Have some candy.

432
00:30:59,030 --> 00:30:59,960
Have some candy.

433
00:31:38,110 --> 00:31:39,030
The guests have arrived.

434
00:31:39,030 --> 00:31:40,830
Why are you here all by yourself?

435
00:31:41,070 --> 00:31:42,920
I got a little tired from working,

436
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,240
so I came up to rest for a bit.

437
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:45,310
It's normal to be tired.

438
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,910
Hard work builds character.

439
00:31:50,270 --> 00:31:50,800
Darling,

440
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:53,680
I wanted to run something by you.

441
00:31:54,830 --> 00:31:56,400
If this deal goes through,

442
00:31:56,860 --> 00:31:58,860
could you let me handle the business

443
00:31:59,040 --> 00:32:00,610
with Commander Feng?

444
00:32:03,250 --> 00:32:05,650
Didn't I have the Master
read your fortune?

445
00:32:05,790 --> 00:32:06,400
You're not cut out for

446
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:08,270
dealing with the outside world.

447
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,830
Just listen to me

448
00:32:10,070 --> 00:32:12,030
and take good care of things at home.

449
00:32:12,030 --> 00:32:13,830
You and I are in this together.

450
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,510
If things are good at home,

451
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:16,400
I'm good.

452
00:32:16,750 --> 00:32:18,810
And when I'm doing well, you will too.

453
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,880
You are right, Darling.

454
00:32:24,350 --> 00:32:25,810
Does your back still hurt?

455
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:27,930
Not anymore.

456
00:32:28,310 --> 00:32:29,970
Then go entertain the guests.

457
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:43,480
It doesn't look good
to walk
with a cane on such a joyous day,

458
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,650
does it?

459
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:44,680
Shuyi,

460
00:33:44,880 --> 00:33:46,680
I was on fire at the table today.

461
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,330
I cleaned everyone out.

462
00:33:50,510 --> 00:33:52,070
That's your second brother, isn't it?

463
00:33:52,070 --> 00:33:53,000
I've heard

464
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,590
he's a sore loser.

465
00:33:54,790 --> 00:33:55,640
He lost a little money

466
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,240
and flipped the whole table.

467
00:33:57,350 --> 00:33:58,680
Talk about being petty.

468
00:33:59,500 --> 00:34:00,670
My second brother

469
00:34:01,110 --> 00:34:03,160
has been obsessed with money
since he was a kid.

470
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,490
Getting money out of him

471
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:07,080
is harder than getting blood from a stone.

472
00:34:07,750 --> 00:34:10,150
Remember that fortune teller
we saw last time?

473
00:34:10,150 --> 00:34:12,000
You know I don't usually
believe in that sort of thing,

474
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:13,110
but this time I do.

475
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,630
Because he said you're good luck

476
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:15,710
for your husband.

477
00:34:16,110 --> 00:34:18,190
The Qian family wouldn't be
where it is today

478
00:34:18,190 --> 00:34:19,550
without you.

479
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:22,940
You've only been here a few days,
and you've already figured that out.

480
00:34:22,940 --> 00:34:25,540
I don't know why my third sister
is so stubborn.

481
00:34:26,110 --> 00:34:28,840
She's been going against me
at every turn lately.

482
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:30,000
I can't blame her.

483
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:32,060
My eldest brother and I

484
00:34:32,230 --> 00:34:33,360
spoiled her rotten.

485
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:34,900
By the way, Huaiyi,

486
00:34:35,420 --> 00:34:36,330
didn't you say

487
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:38,920
our eldest brother was coming
to celebrate with us?

488
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:40,380
I would have forgotten
if you hadn't mentioned it.

489
00:34:40,380 --> 00:34:41,290
I'd forgotten all about it.

490
00:34:41,290 --> 00:34:42,250
I'll go get him.

491
00:34:50,550 --> 00:34:54,110
Brother!

492
00:34:54,670 --> 00:34:55,840
Brother, wake up!

493
00:34:58,030 --> 00:34:58,760
Silly Liang,

494
00:34:59,340 --> 00:35:00,270
why are you here?

495
00:35:00,510 --> 00:35:01,800
You said you were going to
find the eldest Qian brother.

496
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:02,550
You never came back,

497
00:35:02,550 --> 00:35:03,590
so I got worried.

498
00:35:03,670 --> 00:35:04,110
Wait,

499
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:05,550
what happened to you?

500
00:35:14,510 --> 00:35:15,150
It seems

501
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:17,820
the Tianxiang Sect has made their move.

502
00:35:17,820 --> 00:35:19,740
They took the ledger?

503
00:35:20,070 --> 00:35:21,900
Before he died, Qian Huairen told me

504
00:35:21,900 --> 00:35:23,430
the ledger was already gone

505
00:35:23,690 --> 00:35:25,290
when he returned yesterday.

506
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:27,150
Brother,

507
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:29,590
the auspicious hour is approaching.

508
00:35:29,590 --> 00:35:31,120
We're just waiting for you.

509
00:35:31,670 --> 00:35:32,670
What should we do?

510
00:35:32,710 --> 00:35:33,320
Brother!

511
00:35:35,510 --> 00:35:36,190
Brother!

512
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:39,110
Brother!

513
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:43,200
Break it down!

514
00:35:47,590 --> 00:35:50,710
Brother!

515
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:55,280
Brother!

516
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:30,440
Brother, wake up!

517
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:33,230
It's Huaijin, brother!

518
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,000
Who did this?

519
00:36:37,100 --> 00:36:38,020
Who did this?

520
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:39,450
Who did this?

521
00:36:46,830 --> 00:36:48,630
Did you see Shangguan Chengming

522
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,680
in the front courtyard just now?

523
00:36:53,110 --> 00:36:53,970
Second Master!

524
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:55,450
Second Master!

525
00:36:56,910 --> 00:36:58,510
We've searched everywhere,

526
00:36:58,610 --> 00:37:00,070
but there's no sign of him.

527
00:37:09,330 --> 00:37:10,860
We can't hide here for long.

528
00:37:11,710 --> 00:37:12,440
Silly Liang,

529
00:37:12,510 --> 00:37:13,280
go inside and

530
00:37:13,330 --> 00:37:14,630
find a place to hide down there.

531
00:37:14,630 --> 00:37:15,490
What about you?

532
00:37:17,110 --> 00:37:17,910
I have to go up.

533
00:37:18,370 --> 00:37:19,440
If I go up,

534
00:37:19,630 --> 00:37:21,020
they won't come down here to search.

535
00:37:21,020 --> 00:37:21,480
No.

536
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:22,750
I'm going with you.

537
00:37:22,750 --> 00:37:24,410
We'll fight them if we have to!

538
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,480
Listen to me.

539
00:37:25,820 --> 00:37:27,100
Go inside and find a place to hide.

540
00:37:27,100 --> 00:37:28,430
No matter what happens,

541
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:29,780
do not come out.

542
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,480
No!

543
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,030
If you go up there alone, playing the hero
and getting yourself killed,

544
00:37:33,030 --> 00:37:33,920
I could never live with myself,

545
00:37:33,920 --> 00:37:34,900
even if I make it out alive.

546
00:37:34,900 --> 00:37:37,560
Who says I'm going up there
to get myself killed?

547
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:39,480
Silly Liang,

548
00:37:39,650 --> 00:37:41,710
do you remember what you promised me?

549
00:37:49,490 --> 00:37:50,620
Until we meet again.

550
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:04,840
It really is you.

551
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:06,000
It's you.

552
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,760
You killed our brother?

553
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:09,960
Yes.

554
00:38:11,150 --> 00:38:12,070
I killed him.

555
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,550
Then I'll shoot you right now!

556
00:38:13,550 --> 00:38:15,280
If he didn't die, you all would!

557
00:38:16,110 --> 00:38:17,360
I was saving you.

558
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,330
What do you mean?

559
00:38:19,520 --> 00:38:20,720
It's just one ledger,

560
00:38:21,110 --> 00:38:22,960
yet you've dragged this out for so long.

561
00:38:22,960 --> 00:38:25,090
Commander Feng has lost his patience.

562
00:38:26,030 --> 00:38:27,720
This is your warning.

563
00:38:28,510 --> 00:38:29,150
The ledger

564
00:38:29,150 --> 00:38:31,080
is on its way to Commander Feng now.

565
00:38:31,110 --> 00:38:33,370
You really think you still have a choice?

566
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:35,590
Then we'll trade our lives for his.

567
00:38:35,590 --> 00:38:36,320
Fine,

568
00:38:36,670 --> 00:38:38,670
then your whole family
will go down with you.

569
00:38:38,670 --> 00:38:40,340
That woman you just brought home,

570
00:38:40,340 --> 00:38:41,760
your sister, your brother-in-law,

571
00:38:41,760 --> 00:38:43,800
and everyone in the Qian family

572
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:44,840
will die!

573
00:38:45,880 --> 00:38:47,080
Commander Feng's men

574
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:49,280
will be here soon.

575
00:38:52,360 --> 00:38:53,290
Second Brother.

576
00:39:17,550 --> 00:39:18,710
Tie him up.

577
00:39:28,070 --> 00:39:29,070
For generations,

578
00:39:30,510 --> 00:39:31,710
our Qian family

579
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:35,250
had been in the herbal medicine business.

580
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:37,700
We were doing just fine

581
00:39:39,920 --> 00:39:40,920
until

582
00:39:43,110 --> 00:39:46,040
the Tianxiang Sect set their sights
on us unexpectly

583
00:39:46,190 --> 00:39:47,920
and forced us to work with them.

584
00:39:48,590 --> 00:39:50,670
To save my sister and me,

585
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:52,920
my brother had to agree

586
00:39:53,670 --> 00:39:55,130
to make medicine for them.

587
00:39:57,150 --> 00:39:58,410
But the Tianxiang Sect

588
00:40:00,230 --> 00:40:02,190
only wanted various anesthetics

589
00:40:03,190 --> 00:40:04,070
and poisons.

590
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:06,740
My brother made medicine for them

591
00:40:07,430 --> 00:40:09,160
and was often forced to test it.

592
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,800
He became

593
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:13,200
more and more eccentric.

594
00:40:13,590 --> 00:40:15,110
His health broke down

595
00:40:15,720 --> 00:40:17,920
at a young age.

596
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:20,590
Shangguan Chengming

597
00:40:21,510 --> 00:40:22,400
must die.

598
00:40:23,010 --> 00:40:24,380
If I don't kill him,

599
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:26,610
my brother won't rest in peace.

600
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:30,550
Whether it's Commander Feng
or Commander Ma,

601
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:32,430
they all have to die.

602
00:40:38,010 --> 00:40:40,260
[In the next episode]

603
00:40:41,940 --> 00:40:44,140
Sect Master invites you to watch a play.

604
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:48,090
I left the mortal world
to practice physiognomy.

605
00:40:48,190 --> 00:40:50,730
Life and death,
I would remain within the sect.

606
00:40:50,730 --> 00:40:52,590
That was the oath your master and I

607
00:40:52,780 --> 00:40:54,410
swore all those years ago.

608
00:40:54,680 --> 00:40:56,070
Once you enter this sect,

609
00:40:56,070 --> 00:40:57,630
there is no turning back.

610
00:40:57,660 --> 00:40:59,210
Greet Sect Master.

611
00:41:04,490 --> 00:41:06,250
Everyone calls you Sect Master.

612
00:41:06,250 --> 00:41:07,240
but are you really worthy of the title?

613
00:41:07,240 --> 00:41:09,440
Everything you do is beneath contempt.

614
00:41:10,270 --> 00:41:12,460
This man is up to no good.

615
00:41:12,850 --> 00:41:14,330
Better take his eyes.
